---- printing ⍝

ᚡᚫ a j n: print slots j … j+n−1 of a ⍝
⦃
  ⧖ ⧖ ⧖
  ⧗̱⁰ ⧗¹ ⧗¹ ⧗² ⊞
  ⦄ ⥀
